<!doctype html><html lang="es"><meta charset="utf-8"><meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1"><title>Espacios y solicitudes · Ecclesia</title>
<style>body{font:18px system-ui;max-width:55rem;margin:auto;padding:1.5rem;color:#18352c;background:#f7f5ef}a{color:#136650}label{display:block;margin:.8rem 0}input,select,textarea,button{font:inherit;max-width:100%;padding:.5rem}textarea{width:95%}section,article{border-top:1px solid #becbc4;padding:1rem 0}dt{font-weight:bold}dd{margin:0 0 1rem;overflow-wrap:anywhere}button{cursor:pointer}pre{white-space:pre-wrap;overflow-wrap:anywhere}</style><main><a href="/iglesias">Iglesias</a><h1>Seguimiento privado</h1><p>Introduzca folio y clave del comprobante. No incluya estas credenciales en enlaces ni mensajes.</p><% if (error) { %><p role="alert"><%= error %></p><% } %>
<form method="post" action="/solicitudes/seguimiento"><input type="hidden" name="_csrf" value="<%= csrf %>"><label>Folio <input name="folio" maxlength="24" required autocomplete="off"></label><label>Clave <input type="password" name="clave" maxlength="43" required autocomplete="off"></label><button>Consultar</button></form></main></html>
